      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Veteran status wasn't linked to the age of the account. There were plenty of users that were around for years, even before the Steam release, that weren't Veteran status. So it's unclear what that status was meant to indicate (even though the word \"veteran\" implies longevity).",
