      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Veteran rank (and all ranks really) should NOT exist. The system did a lot of good in terms of getting the low hanging trolls out, but it did nothing for the more persistent and subtle, while simultaneously causing terrible and unnecessary harm in the form of elitism and segregation. My personal solution would be to improve the avatar rating system, create a score based on how many hide an avatar or block its users, and tie the safety settings to both of those. Something like “if avatar reputation + user reputation < 0, it’s malicious and should be disabled by default”. Of course both should start with a default minor positive value, and gradually increase with time and decrease with hide’s and blocks. Oh and they shouldn’t be so clearly displayed as “ranks”.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
