      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Veteran rank served absolutely no purpose, and most certainly wouldn't distinguish trust worthy people from crashers and trolls any more than the trusted rank already does. Even during the short period of the trust system beta, I saw multiple crashers with the veteran rank.\n\nBy your logic, after a few more months we'd simply need yet another \"Veteran+1\" rank to distinguish people, because everyone would have climbed to veteran by then. You can't just add a new rank every year.",
      "viewerReactions": null
