      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Easy? I have been stuck on Known for more than 1000 hours, i have uploaded 14 avatars, have 400 friends, spent an eternity on public lobbies, the only thing that would get me to trusted is to upload a world now, but i have 0 knowledge on making them and 0 desire aswell.\nThey should remove ranks alltogether and leave 2, newbie and trusted, get everyone that have more than 300 hours on trusted side and stop this nonsence grind for ranks, leave newbie rank for safety, not sure how many times i have been almost crashed or harrassed by new users and visitors, most of the time i just block them, and thanks to safety settings i have their avatars disabled by default.\nI may have been blocked, as everyone, and blocked a lot of people myself, but grinding into trusted should be ENOUGH.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
